WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.403
Oh, look, look.

00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:07.327
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.327 --> 00:00:11.460
"In the Dark" is a new show
about a woman in her twenties

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.930
who's just a hot mess.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:13.763
Hot mess.

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:14.920
A walking tornado.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:15.880
She doesn't do anything

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.350
except eat candy bars and take naps.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.640
Think blacking out
would be a little easier

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.473
when you're blind.

00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:21.306
(man chuckles)

00:00:21.306 --> 00:00:23.010
She is the witness to the murder of

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.440
a young boy named Tyson, who
happens to be her best friend,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.070
and by trying to understand
why that happened

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.010
she's required to pick
her life up a little bit.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.771
Today, we're going to answer
some adulting questions

00:00:31.771 --> 00:00:33.450
from some puppies.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.283
Puppies!

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.904
Hi.

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:39.424
Oooh!

00:00:39.424 --> 00:00:42.007
(Upbeat music)

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.010
- No.
- Yes.

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:45.843
Oh!

00:00:45.843 --> 00:00:46.676
(Brooke laughing)

00:00:46.676 --> 00:00:49.283
I think if you love someone

00:00:49.283 --> 00:00:52.580
and you feel it in your heart,

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:53.765
you should tell them.

00:00:53.765 --> 00:00:54.598
Don't tell him.

00:00:54.598 --> 00:00:55.952
It's too soon.

00:00:55.952 --> 00:00:57.583
Baby, it's too soon.

00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:59.563
- Oh boy.
- Oh my god.

00:00:59.563 --> 00:01:01.577
Oh yeah, she's (mumbles).

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.170
Personally, I wouldn't text.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.340
A text is so impersonal,

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.885
but a nice letter from
an unknown location,

00:01:12.885 --> 00:01:14.494
you can't beat it.

00:01:14.494 --> 00:01:15.794
[Keston] I'm sorry.

00:01:15.794 --> 00:01:16.667
(Keston laughing)

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:17.500
[Morgan] It's the best way
I know how to break up.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:18.333
It's snail mail.

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:19.621
Just move.

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:20.454
Start a new life, new identity,

00:01:20.454 --> 00:01:21.287
and get a new license.

00:01:21.287 --> 00:01:22.480
Hi.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:25.970
Oh, I'm sorry. You're very loosey-goosey.

00:01:29.753 --> 00:01:31.765
Hank, I think it's okay to be nervous

00:01:31.765 --> 00:01:33.410
and to get a little sweaty.

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.100
I always get the upper-lip
sweat right here.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.470
- I always just point it out.
- Yeah.

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.400
And then people are like,
"Oh, I get that too."

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.985
And then it's like, oh great.

00:01:39.985 --> 00:01:40.818
Hi.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:42.793
Hi, sweetheart.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.040
Don't cry.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.790
I don't know why this one got me.

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:51.664
I think you should get my name.

00:01:51.664 --> 00:01:53.120
(Perry laughing)

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.120
If I saw a dog with a cat tattoo,

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:55.953
I'd be like...

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:58.800
Have you asked Logan
how he feels about that?

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.616
- No.
- He's escaping.

00:02:00.616 --> 00:02:01.449
Logan!

00:02:01.449 --> 00:02:02.980
He's, like, I don't want a cat tattoo.

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:04.044
This is the best day of my life.

00:02:04.044 --> 00:02:04.880
(Perry laughing)

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:05.827
[Casey] Be sure to check out

00:02:05.827 --> 00:02:07.730
"In the Dark" on CW,

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.770
on Thursday, April 4 at 9 p.m.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:12.230
If you're looking to adopt a dog,

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.492
go to Deity Animal Rescue and Foundation.

00:02:15.492 --> 00:02:17.990
Because that's where you were.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.123
Ow. Just bit my beard.

00:02:19.123 --> 00:02:19.956
Just bit my beard.

00:02:19.956 --> 00:02:21.143
Hey, hey.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.603
Hey, what is the problem?

